  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;moves along the internal smooth surface of a vertical cylinder of the radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>. Find the force with which the particle acts on the cylinder wall if at the initial moment of time its velocity equals <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>. and forms an angle&nbsp;<math><mrow><mi>α</mi> </mrow> </math> with the horizontal.\r",
